| T1: Normal | `HTTP/1.1 200 OK\r\n...` | ACCEPT | ACCEPT ✅ |
| T2: Bare CR | `HTTP/1.1 200 OK\r\r...` | REJECT | **ACCEPT ❌** |
| T3: CR CR LF | `HTTP/1.1 200 OK\r\r\n...` | REJECT | REJECT ✅ |
| T4: Bare LF | `HTTP/1.1 200 OK\n...` | REJECT | REJECT ✅ |
| T5: Bare CR + CL | `HTTP/1.1 200 OK\r\rCL:4\r\n\r\nEvil` | REJECT | **ACCEPT ❌** |
